    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Inbound').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "=👋 Welcome to the Finance Tracker Bot!\n\nI can help you log receipts and track your daily spending. Just send me a photo of a receipt or type a quick expense (e.g., 'Coffee 35k').\n\n⚠️ Important Privacy Notice:\nThis is a personal portfolio project hosted on a private home lab. While I do my best to keep things secure, and your data will never be shared, please do not upload real banking credentials, highly sensitive financial documents, or personal identification. Feel free to use mock data or blur sensitive parts of your receipts!\n\nNote: As an experimental project, there is no guarantee of 100% uptime or permanent data retention. Please do not use this as your sole financial record.",
        "additionalFields": {
