    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Inbound').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "=<b>🚀 Quick Start Guide</b>\n\nHere is how you can use this bot to manage and track your expenses:\n\n<b>1️⃣ Log an Expense (Receipt Scan)</b>\n• Simply take a photo of your receipt or bill and send it here.\n• The AI will automatically extract the <b>Date</b>, <b>Merchant</b>, <b>Category</b>, <b>Total Amount</b>, and <b>Line Items</b>.\n• You will have a quick <b>🗑️ Delete Entry</b> button attached to undo any accidental uploads.\n\n<b>2️⃣ Query Your Spending</b>\nAsk questions in plain text anytime! For example:\n• <i>\"How much did I spend on Food & Beverage this month?\"</i>\n• <i>\"Show me my transactions this week.\"</i>\n• <i>\"What was my biggest expense recently?\"</i>\n• <i>\"Total spending in August 2026.\"</i>\n\n<b>3️⃣ Tips for Best Results</b>\n• Ensure receipts are well-lit and the totals are clearly visible.\n• All amounts are tracked and formatted automatically in Rupiah (Rp).\n\n<i>Ready to test it? Send your first receipt photo or ask a spending question!</i>",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
